{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ沈金！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/25/7150627/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わくわくだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/25/7150627/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、発売された『B.L.T.』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載ってます！\n一人で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構、中田推しには読みごたえがあるものに\nなってると思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/25/7150627/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"語ってこなかった部分も\n今だから触れていいかな？\nって思っていろいろ話してます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、\n髪型について"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このB.L.T.を読んで\nじっくりちゃんと考えてから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも髪を切った方がいいと思うか\n切らない方がいいと思うか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このブログのコメントで教えてー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理由も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、昨日発売のもの\nもうひとつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『乃木坂46×週刊プレイボーイ2016』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またやっていただけて\nありがたいです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/25/7150627/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は中田はグラビアには載ってないですが\n白黒のページにあちこち登場してますので\nチェックしといてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の沈金のゲストの℃-uteさんについて\n語ってるページもあるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/25/7150627/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それくらい\nいろんな事書いてあります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！あと\n中田が読んで一番面白かったのは\n『乃木坂工事中ディレクター構成作家座談会』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の名前が出てきてた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/25/7150627/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/25/7150627/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回もその文を読んだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/25/7150627/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喋るの苦手だなって思うのやめよう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/25/7150627/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/25/7150627/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}